d  probably will so getting to hang out and  talk spidey with this awesome crew of  spidey lovers was a dream in which then  marvel studios executive dana vazquez  eberhard revealed that the animated show  will be giving its first look during  this panel as well she tweeted back  saying that jeff trammell is going to  talk even more spider-man goodness  surprises and first looks at the  animation panel tomorrow so we assumed  that we were going to be getting some  first looks at san diego comic-con and  it looks like the first one that is  confirmed is going to be for spider-man  freshman year now what's interesting is  that there's been a report recently  stating that tom holland is not going to  be returning to voice peter parker which  is going to be weird now of course it's  a voice and voice actors are pretty  amazing plus voices can be manipulated  to sound like other things so they could  pretty much make the voice sound as  close to tom hollands as possible but i  do find it interesting that tom holland  is not returning now big question that  i've been getting a lot lately from a  lot of people is does this mean that tom  holland is done with spider-man in  general and the answer to that is no i  do not believe so i basically believe  that one tom holland is just an  incredibly busy man and two he kind of  needs a break before going back to do  the next spider-man people keep asking  about a spider-man contract with sony  with disney and although nothing  publicly has been stated yet i want you  to keep in mind what kevin feige and amy  pascal said right after spider-man no  way home was released they confirmed the  two of them together both sony and  marvel that they are already working on  the next spider-man film with tom  holland and they specifically said this  according to them so fans would not have  to worry about the future of spider-man  kevin feige said the only reason that  they are telling us that is because they  don't want us to worry about t